; nothing-conformance.fk — the surface of axiom-1's third state that all four kernels
; agree on, pinned so it stays agreed.
;
; Built 2026-07-28, closing a gap this body had named three times without building:
; `nothing` was an unbound identifier in all three proof walkers, so no cell that
; honoured nothing as first-class could ever reach a second pair of eyes. Every such
; cell was native-only by construction. The walkers now carry it.
;
; ── What was taught, and what was deliberately NOT ──────────────────────────────────
;
; Teaching a walker to AGREE with fkwu by copying fkwu would destroy the only thing a
; walker is for. So the three siblings were given the principled surface and told to
; decline the rest, out loud:
;
;   taught     `nothing` as a distinct first-class value; equal to itself; never equal
;              to 0, to "", or to the empty list; surviving inside lists; `len` of it 0;
;              printing as `nothing`
;   declined   ordering it against a number, and branching on it — both throw in all
;              three walkers rather than answer
;
; That half is the interesting one, and it is there because measuring fkwu first
; turned up two things worth not copying:
;
;   (add (nothing) 1)         -> -8999999999999999997
;   (add (nothing) (nothing)) ->  223372036854775809
;
; That is not a semantics. That is fkwu's own value encoding leaking through the
; arithmetic path — absence escaping as a number, which is the exact error this body
; spent three receipts arguing against. A walker that reproduced those constants would
; be agreeing by imitation and would never be able to witness the leak. So the walkers
; throw where fkwu invents, and the disagreement stays available.
;
; Measured alongside it, and separate from nothing: `ne` answers `nothing` for every
; input on fkwu's source path — `(ne 1 2)` and `(ne 1 1)` both. It is not implemented
; there. Named here because it was found here; not fixed here.
;
; So this cell pins only the agreed surface. Nothing below does arithmetic on nothing,
; orders it, or branches on it — by design, because those are the places the four
; kernels honestly differ and the difference is the point.
;
; preludes: form-stdlib/core.fk
; witnessed: 2026-07-28 -> 11111111, four-way (fkwu, go, rust, ts)

(do
    (defn nc-nothing? (v) (if (eq v (nothing)) 1 0))

    ; a table whose fallthrough is nothing — the shape every real use has: a lookup
    ; that answers with a value, or answers with the ground when it holds no row.
    (defn nc-lookup (key)
        (if (str_eq key "held")       11
        (if (str_eq key "also-held")  12
            (nothing))))

    ; nothing riding inside a composition and coming back out unchanged
    (defn nc-carrier () (list 1 (nothing) 3))

    (defn nc-bit (cond bit) (if cond bit 0))
    (defn nothing-conformance-check ()
        (add (add (add (add (add (add (add
            ; 1 — nothing is equal to itself
            (nc-bit (eq (nc-nothing? (nothing)) 1) 1)
            ; 2 — and is not 0. The ground, not a missing 0
            (nc-bit (eq (nc-nothing? 0) 0) 10))
            ; 3 — the comparison holds in both directions
            (nc-bit (eq (eq 0 (nothing)) 0) 100))
            ; 4 — nor is it the empty string
            (nc-bit (eq (eq (nothing) "") 0) 1000))
            ; 5 — nor the empty list: an absent value is not an empty container
            (nc-bit (eq (eq (nothing) (empty)) 0) 10000))
            ; 6 — len of nothing is 0, and that 0 is a length, not the value
            (nc-bit (eq (len (nothing)) 0) 100000))
            ; 7 — it survives inside a composition and comes back still itself
            (nc-bit (if (eq (nc-nothing? (nth (nc-carrier) 1)) 1)
                        (if (eq (nth (nc-carrier) 0) 1) 1 0) 0) 1000000))
            ; 8 — a table answers with a value where it holds a row, and with the
            ;     ground where it does not — never with a guess and never with 0
            (nc-bit (if (eq (nc-lookup "held") 11)
                        (if (eq (nc-nothing? (nc-lookup "unheld")) 1)
                            (if (eq (nc-nothing? (nc-lookup "held")) 0) 1 0) 0) 0) 10000000)))
    0)
